@startuml gateway-trust-boundary-sequence
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title API GATEWAY - TRUST BOUNDARY FILTER AS-IS

actor Client
participant "GatewayTrustBoundaryFilter" as Filter
participant "Route chain" as Chain
participant "Downstream service" as Service

Client -> Filter : request(path, headers)
alt URL chứa segment "internal"
  Filter --> Client : 403 Forbidden
else public route
  Filter -> Filter : generate UUID requestId
  Filter -> Filter : remove exact RESERVED headers
  Filter -> Filter : remove x-verified-* / x-internal-* / x-authenticated-*
  Filter -> Filter : replace X-Request-Id
  Filter -> Chain : sanitized request
  Chain -> Service : routed request
  Service --> Chain : response
  Chain --> Filter : response
  Filter --> Client : response + X-Request-Id
end

note right of Filter #FFF2CC
  Code hiện tại chưa chặn tổng quát x-actor-*.
  Service không được tin cậy các header actor do client gửi.
end note

@enduml
